OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,FA $1.4 trillion dollar lawsuit has
OL,7,Fstarted in California against Meta,
OL,8,Fwith claims that children have been
OL,9,Fdeliberately exposed to harm on
OL,10,FFacebook and Instragram, as ITV News
OL,11,FCorrespondent Debi Edward reports
OL,13,FOpening arguments have begun in a
OL,14,Fpivotal trial for Facebook and
OL,15,FInstagram owner Meta in the US, where
OL,16,Fseveral states are seeking billions of
OL,17,Fdollars in damages for social media
OL,18,Fharms to children.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,FAttorneys general from California,
OL,7,FColorado, Kentucky and New Jersey are
OL,8,Fseeking a financial penalty that
OL,9,Fcould, in theory, total as much as #1
OL,10,Ftrillion and lead to changes in how
OL,11,Fthe company operates Facebook and
OL,12,FInstagram.
OL,14,FThe four states are among 29 who sued
OL,15,Fthe tech giant in 2023 over child
OL,16,Fsafety and privacy, and the other 25
OL,17,Fwill go to trial at a later date.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,FThe lawsuit accuses the social media
OL,7,Fgiant of contributing to the youth
OL,8,Fmental health crisis by knowingly and
OL,9,Fdeliberately designing features that
OL,10,Faddict children to its platforms.
OL,12,FIt also argues that Meta routinely
OL,13,Fcollects data on children under 13
OL,14,Fwithout their parents' consent, in
OL,15,Fviolation of federal law.
OL,17,F"This week, we're in court with the
OL,18,Flargest consumer protection lawsuit in
OL,19,FAmerican history," Kentucky Attorney
OL,20,FGeneral Russell Coleman said in a
OL,21,Fwritten statement.
OL,26,@yD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,F"We'll show a jury that Meta concealed
OL,7,Fwhat it knew about the harm its
OL,8,Fproducts cause young people because
OL,9,Flooking away was more profitable,"
OL,11,FMeta said it believes it has a strong
OL,12,Fdefence case.
OL,14,F"We are proud of our record in
OL,15,Fprotecting teens on our platforms and
OL,16,Fthe amount of effort that we've put
OL,17,Finto developing protections over the
OL,18,Fyears, even before these cases were
OL,19,Fever filed, and continuing to the
OL,20,Fpresent day," the company said in a
OL,21,Fwritten statement.
OL,26,@qD@bO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
