PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,F"We look forward to showing the judge
OL,7,Fand the jury those facts in court."
OL,9,FUS District Judge Yvonne Gonzalez
OL,10,FRogers in Oakland is overseeing the
OL,11,Fproceedings, which are expected to
OL,12,Flast six to eight weeks with testimony
OL,13,Ffrom Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg and
OL,14,Fother executives and former employees.
OL,16,FIf Meta loses the trial, the court
OL,17,Fwould have wide discretion over the
OL,18,Fsize of any financial penalty, and
OL,19,Flegal experts say anything close to a
OL,20,Ftrillion would be unlikely.
OL,26,@oD@cO]
