OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,FThe trial is the latest in an
OL,7,Favalanche of lawsuits against Meta
OL,8,FPlatforms and other social media
OL,9,Fcompanies including Google's YouTube,
OL,10,FTikTok and Snap, over arguments that
OL,11,Ftheir platforms harm young people,
OL,12,Fillegally collect their data and are
OL,13,Fdeliberately designed to addict them.
OL,15,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
