PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,FEarlier this month, a different US
OL,7,Fcourt in New Mexico ordered Instagram
OL,8,Fand Facebook parent company Meta to
OL,9,Fpay $567 (#421.5 million) to address
OL,10,Fharms to young people from its
OL,11,Fplatforms.
OL,13,FThe penalty was in addition to the
OL,14,F$375 million (#278.9 million) in civil
OL,15,Fpenalties that jurors ordered against
OL,16,FMeta in March, after determining the
OL,17,Fcompany knowingly harmed children's
OL,18,Fmental health and concealed what it
OL,19,Fknew about child sexual exploitation
OL,20,Fon its platforms.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
