FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1787078908
OL,3,CMeta trial over social media addiction
OL,4,Cand child privacy claims begins in US
OL,6,FIn the second phase, prosecutors asked
OL,7,Fthe judge to impose fundamental
OL,8,Fchanges at Meta aimed at reining in
OL,9,Faddictive features, improving age
OL,10,Fverification and preventing child
OL,11,Fsexual exploitation through default
OL,12,Fprivacy settings and closer oversight.
OL,14,FThe total amount Meta is responsible
OL,15,Ffor ` $942 million (#700 million) ` is
OL,16,Fa small fraction of its annual profit,
OL,17,Fwhich was about $60 billion (#44.6
OL,18,Fbillion) in 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
